![title](73,53,617,78) # Field equations and their friends

![text](75,98,665,133) Bold letters are vectors. SI units throughout; the constants carry their usual meaning.

![text](76,157,348,170) Gauss's law, in differential form:

![formula](450,181,926,207) $$
\nabla \cdot \mathbf{E} = \frac{\rho}{\varepsilon_0}
\quad \text{(1)}
$$

![text](76,233,284,246) No magnetic monopoles:

![formula](452,257,926,281) $$
\nabla \cdot \mathbf{B} = 0
\quad \text{(2)}
$$

![text](76,307,301,320) Faraday's law of induction:

![formula](436,333,926,357) $$
\nabla \times \mathbf{E} = -\frac{\partial \mathbf{B}}{\partial t}
\quad \text{(3)}
$$

![text](76,383,418,396) Ampère's law with Maxwell's correction:

![formula](395,409,926,433) $$
\nabla \times \mathbf{B} = \mu_0 \mathbf{J} + \mu_0 \varepsilon_0 \frac{\partial \mathbf{E}}{\partial t}
\quad \text{(4)}
$$

![text](76,457,434,472) The time-dependent Schrödinger equation:

![formula](370,483,926,509) $$
i\hbar \frac{\partial \Psi}{\partial t} = \left[ -\frac{\hbar^2}{2m} \nabla^2 + V(\mathbf{r}, t) \right] \Psi
\quad \text{(5)}
$$

![text](76,532,476,547) Momentum balance for an incompressible fluid:

![formula](337,559,926,583) $$
\rho \left( \frac{\partial \mathbf{u}}{\partial t} + \mathbf{u} \cdot \nabla \mathbf{u} \right) = -\nabla p + \mu \nabla^2 \mathbf{u} + \mathbf{f}
\quad \text{(6)}
$$

![text](76,607,529,622) Planck's law for the spectral radiance of a black body:

![formula](404,633,926,666) $$
B_\nu(T) = \frac{2h\nu^3}{c^2} \frac{1}{e^{h\nu/k_B T} - 1}
\quad \text{(7)}
$$

![text](76,683,236,696) The Lorentz factor:

![formula](435,707,926,739) $$
\gamma = \frac{1}{\sqrt{1 - v^2/c^2}}
\quad \text{(8)}
$$

